  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29338001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "好了，岛主，我要睁开眼睛了哦——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29338002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "看吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29338003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "哇，好宽敞的屋子……啊，还有浴室！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29338004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "浴室里还有这么大的浴缸……而且已经装满热水了？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29338005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "因为你很喜欢泡澡，所以提前把热水准备好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29338006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "诶嘿嘿，现在就开始泡可以吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29338007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可以是可以，那我就——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29338008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "岛主，再在门外陪我聊聊天吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29338009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "啊，没有什么奇怪的意思……只是奶奶也经常和我在泡澡的时候聊天的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29338010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……好的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29338011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "嘿嘿，那穗香就进去了哦~嘿咻！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29338012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "听到了水溅出来的声音……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29338013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "唔哈——泡澡好舒服……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29338014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "穗香",
          "text": "嗯……之后我们去玩什么好呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
